Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 11:49:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] @ Phase 8 (complete): Qwen3VL weight conversion +
 safetensors support

apply_weight_convert.py changes:
- Add qwen3_vl weight mapping spec with:
  - LLM common keys (embed_tokens, norm, lm_head)
  - LLM decoder layer keys (Qwen3-style: q/k/v proj, q/k norm, o_proj, MLP)
  - Vision encoder keys (patch_embed, pos_embed, blocks x27, merger)
  - Vision layer template (norm1/2, attn.qkv, attn.proj, mlp.linear_fc1/2)
  - Deepstack merger mapping (3 mergers from vision layers 8/16/24)
- Add safetensors loading: priority check for *.safetensors files
  using safetensors.torch.load_file, fallback to HF from_pretrained
- Update detect_model_type() to recognize qwen3_vl
- Update get_num_layers() to return dict with vision_depth + deepstack_indexes
- Update convert() to expand vision layers and deepstack mergers
- KV merge applies to language_model layers for qwen3_vl

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
